Injection & 0.85 & 0.15 & 0.04 & 1.4 \\
Trust exploitation & 0.87 & 0.13 & 0.09 & 1.6 \\
Belief manipulation & 0.86 & 0.14 & 0.07 & 1.6 \\
Coordination & 0.79 & 0.21 & 0.11 & 2.0 \\
\bottomrule\noalign{}
\end{longtable}
}

Lower NNT indicates greater marginal benefit of full CIF deployment over
the best available single mechanism. An NNT of 1.4 for injection attacks
means that for roughly every 1.4 attacks encountered, full CIF prevents
one additional successful attack that the best single mechanism would
miss.
\end{block}
\end{block}

